    "updated_at": "2021-04-30T15:47:08Z",
    "body": "> It looks like you have configured multiple zsh themes in your `.zshrc`. Does starship work if disable all the other ones besides starship?\r\n\r\nFollowing lines look like probable cause: \r\n```sh\r\nprompt_context() {\r\n  if [[ \"$USER\" != \"$DEFAULT_USER\" || -n \"$SSH_CLIENT\" ]]; then\r\n    prompt_segment black default \"%(!.%{%F{yellow}%}.)$USER\"\r\n  fi\r\n}\r\nsource  ~/powerlevel9k/powerlevel9k.zsh-theme\r\nprompt_context() {}\r\n```",
